Source: hew
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: The Hew Project Developers <hello@hew.sh>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://hew.sh
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: hew
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, gcc | clang, libc6-dev
Description: The Hew programming language compiler and package manager
 Hew is a statically-typed, actor-oriented programming language targeting
 concurrent and distributed systems. This package includes the hew compiler
 driver with the built-in package manager, language server and actor observer
 TUI, and the standard library.

Package: hew-dbgsym
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Section: debug
Priority: optional
Depends: hew (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: debug symbols for the Hew compiler
 Separate DWARF for the hew compiler driver, installed under
 /usr/lib/debug/.build-id so gdb, lldb and eu-stack symbolize a compiler
 crash by the binary's build-id.
